description:
Activate Grim Monolith by tapping it, adding {C}{C}{C}
Activate Candelabra of Tawnos by paying {2} and tapping it, untapping Grim Monolith and Candelabra of Tawnos as they are lands due to Toph.
Repeat.

Activate Grim Monolith's first ability by tapping it, adding {C}{C}{C}
Activate Grim Monolith's second ability by paying {4}
Locus of Enlightenment triggers, untapping Grim Monolith
Holding priority, activate Grim Monolith by tapping it, adding {C}{C}{C}
Resolve Grim Monolith's ability from step 2, untapping it.
Repeat

Activate Trazyn using Grim Monolith's ability by tapping it, adding {C}{C}{C}
Activate Voltaic Construct or activate Trazyn using Voltaic Construct's ability by paying {2}, untapping Trazyn.
Repeat.
